# Cerebro's own directory in a consumer — runtime state (agent state files, stop flags, the agents'
# worktrees, the personal models.conf) that never reaches git, plus the project's tracked
# declarations (cb-epr), which every clone needs. Same shape as the .claude block below: everything
# ignored, except what is deliberately tracked. `.cerebro/*` and not `.cerebro/` — a negation only
# works when the parent directory itself is not ignored.
.cerebro/worktrees
.cerebro/state
